body:
And... I got it figured out 10 minutes after posting this.

I needed to include the autocomplete import like so:

```
import { connectAutocomplete } from 'instantsearch.js/es/connectors';
```

Then I needed to call the renderAutocomplete like so:

```
const customAutocomplete = connectAutocomplete(
  renderAutocomplete
);
```

The docs currently show to use it like this:

```
const customAutocomplete = instantsearch.connectors.connectAutocomplete(
  renderAutocomplete
);
```

Which was not working for me, so make sure to call `connectAutocomplete` by itself. Thought I would post my solution here in case anyone else ran into the same issue 👍
